# On a case-insensitive filesystem (macOS/Windows default, core.ignorecase=true) the *.sqlite
# glob above also matches the ForgeKit.Api.Migrations.Sqlite project directory, silently
# excluding any new file added under it that was not already force-added. Re-include it.
!api/ForgeKit.Api.Migrations.Sqlite/

